title : tcsin2
                               TCS

*****************************************************
		  hi friends,
		    i came to know that your campus selections are 
		    round the corner. So i am giving the  
		    tcs test pattern as well as about how to do well in 
		    the test. 
		    
		    we got the same old paper with slight modifications.
		
		    part-1: PSYCHOMETRIC TEST  is same.
		    this contains 150 questions.very easy .
		    time =30 minutes
		    there is no right or wrong answers to this part.
		    but think positively while answering.
		
		    part-2(a):VERBAL COMPREHENSION.
		    in old paper we can find 40 words.but in new paper
		    they gave 20 among those 40.
		    no new words in that part 
		    time =5 minutes
		    write correct answers for 15 to 16 questions.
		
		    part-2(b):GENERAL REASONING (or)QUANTITATIVE part..
		    old paper contains 15 questions 
		    this paper has 10 among them.
		    no new questions.
		    time=10 minutes.
		    write correct answers for all  (or) leave one.
		 
		
		    part-1(c):CRITICAL REASONING..
		    old paper contains 13 passages with 50 questions.
		    2 more questions have been added to passage no:10
		    4 more passages with 18 questions were added to that .
		    so new paper contains 70 questions in total.
		    these 4 new passages are very easy.
		    time =45 minutes.       
		    
		    so duration of test= 90 min.
		  
		    since all the students know the test paper
		    normally they will fix some range as qualifying marks.
		    generally that range is 75 to 85 marks.
		   
		    so your aim is to get 80 marks,
		    but it doesn't mean that you should attempt for 
		    80 questions only.
		    you should attempt all the paper.
		    especially in PSYCHOMETRIC TEST one should attempt
		    all the questions.those who had attempted <145 were
		    disqualified in our campus
		    
		    regarding critical reasoning is concerned..
		    they will give more credit to this in qualifying 
		    anybody.
		    so i have one suggestion for this.
		    better to complete 50 old questions within 20 min.
		    and spend the remainig 25 min to do well in the 
		    20 new questions.
		
		    do rough work for the part-2(b) in the answer sheet
		    on the backside.   
		
		    i hope these tips are sufficient to get clear the 
		    my company's (haa...YES..) test.
		 
		    i will send another mail within a few days regarding
		    my experience with TCS interview and 
		    about commonly asked questions.
		    
		    TILL THEN....
		    bye
		    with LOVE 
		    SUBROV.
		
	-------------------------------------------
				    guduru suresh kumar
		
		
